{"ID":"20240515131402-9ycgfqm","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240515131402-9ycgfqm","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515131402-9ycgfqm\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515141622-8ceyxlo\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515141622-8ceyxlo\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:200,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515141622-8ceyxlo\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:311,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:311\u0026#125;","title":"077","type":"doc","updated":"20240515141622"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240515141622-8ceyxlo","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 848px;","id":"20240515141622-8ceyxlo","updated":"20240515141622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期：2008/08/07"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"LW"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"男"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"約六七十歲  瘦"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/08/07"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因：\n下背痛(師曰帶脈)\n無胃口，排氣多，體重下降\n倦怠，肌肉消失，牙痛，視力差\n關節痛"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"睡尚好"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一直口渴，喜冷飲"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雙足冷"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小便不頻尿"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"睡時身熱，不蓋被。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診：右脈洪大"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診：淡黃濕\n2、眼診 :左眼瞳孔反應慢，肺區有痰"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"耳診："}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷： 濕入血脈中，脈大為癆症"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"針灸處方： "}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方： \n桂枝三錢，白芍六錢，麻黃三錢，白朮三錢，炮附子三錢，炙甘草三錢，知母五錢，\n防風五錢，茯苓五錢。麥芽糖一罐，每服時加一匙入內，沖。\n五付，\n九碗煮三碗，\n早晚飯前服。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說：病人肌肉之津液喪失使肌肉看起來變小。水去了心肺系統導致脈大。\n處方內含桂枝勺藥知母湯治癆症，小建中湯治病人胃口不好，苓桂甘棗湯去濕治帶脈痛。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："}]}]}]}]}